\newlabel{fig:perclass}{{16}{16}{Per-class F1 (5-model ensemble, \texttt {val\_dir}). Directional single-object motions score highest; ``pretending'' and direction-ambiguous classes score lowest (Sec.~\ref {sec:failure})}{figure.16}{}}
